{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-364",
  "title": "A new category",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A new category"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on my comprehensive market analysis, here's what stands out about TQL's potential:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🎯 Most Compelling Opportunities:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **The \"jq for Humans\" Positioning**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This resonates strongly because:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**jq has 20k+ GitHub stars** but everyone complains about its complexity"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Developers already search for alternatives** - this is an established pain point"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Low barrier to entry** - CLI tools spread organically through dev communities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Natural language makes it 10x more accessible** while keeping jq's power"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **No-Code Data Layer Gap**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This aligns perfectly with your original vision but expands it:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Retool/Webflow/Airtable all need flexible data backends**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Current solutions force schema decisions upfront** - TQL's schema-agnostic approach is revolutionary here"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Platform partnerships could drive rapid adoption** without massive sales effort"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Cross-Dataset Analytics Niche**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This feels like the most technically defensible advantage:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Nobody else can query GitHub API + Stripe + local JSON files simultaneously**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**EAV model enables joins across completely different data structures**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Solves real enterprise data integration problems** that cost companies millions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 Recommended Focus Areas:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Immediate (0-6 months):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Polish the CLI experience** - make it the best jq alternative"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Build developer community** - GitHub, npm, brew installation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Create stunning demos** - show queries that are impossible with other tools"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Medium-term (6-18 months):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **No-code platform integrations** - become Retool's preferred data layer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Enterprise features** - auth, caching, team collaboration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **SaaS offering** - cloud version with managed storage"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Long-term (18+ months):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Visual query builder** - drag-and-drop interface for complex queries"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **AI copilot** - proactive insights and query suggestions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Platform ecosystem** - third-party extensions and data connectors"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 Unique Insight from the Research:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The market analysis revealed that **TQL isn't just a better query tool - it's a new category**. The closest analogy is how Figma created \"collaborative design\" as a category between traditional design tools and Google Docs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "TQL could create **\"conversational data exploration\"** as a new category between:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Traditional BI (heavy, structured, slow)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SQL/GraphQL (technical, schema-dependent)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "jq (powerful but arcane)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Natural language AI (conversational but unreliable)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your technology sits perfectly at the intersection of all these - structured enough for reliability, conversational enough for accessibility, and flexible enough for any data."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🎪 Where to Focus First:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'd recommend **starting with developers** via the CLI route because:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **They'll appreciate the technical innovation** most"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Viral distribution** through package managers and GitHub"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Provides battle-testing** before enterprise deployment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Creates advocate base** for the no-code version"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What aspect of this resonates most with how you see TQL evolving? The developer tool path, the no-code platform play, or something else entirely?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}